cores/sc55/ and modules/roland/; each release names the commit it was
built from. Releases up to SC55_20261120.rbf were built from this
repository's own history, which still holds that source. The H8/532 MCU,
the M37450 sub-MCU, the gate array and the PCM chip are written after
Nuked-SC55 (nukeykt; jcmoyer's fork, GPL-2.0-or-later). The RBF includes
the MiSTer framework (Template_MiSTer, GPL-2.0) and the shared synthframe
modules (MIT).

tools/romset.py reads the ROM table in
third_party/nuked-sc55/doc/supported_romsets.rst, copied from Nuked-SC55
(GPL-2.0-or-later, third_party/nuked-sc55/LICENSE).

mra/*.mra are written by tools/romset.py mra; they name MAME's ROM sets and the CRC32s
of their files, not ROM contents.

No Roland ROMs are included. Users make the ROM pack from their own files
(tools/romset.py).
